    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 4 and takes about 1 hour 30 minutes from start to table. The thing to watch is the order you add the fish: firm-fleshed fish goes in first, shellfish last, so nothing overcooks in the fragrant broth."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bloom the saffron in warm water for at least 10 minutes before using. This releases the colour and flavour far more effectively than adding it directly to the pot."
          }
        ]
      },
